[1028.695351, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.696025, "o", "/-!\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.696776, "o", "Intended policy (from the documented contract of `authorize`), in exact integer arithmetic:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   P = 2013265921, R = 2^32, R_INV = 943718400 (R * R_INV = 1 mod P)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r013265921 * t.toNat % 18446744073709551616 = 2013265921 * t.toNat := Nat.mod_eq_of_lt (by omega)\r\n  have hAB := keyAB x.toNat t."]
[1028.696813, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.698722, "o", "  transcript      = (amount mod 2^32) + (fee mod P) * 2^32\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   monty_surcharge = (transcript * R_INV) mod P\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   total_debit     = amount + monty_surcharge          (exact, unbounded)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The payment is authorized iff total_debit <= balance, and the reported debit is exactly\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> total_debit.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> -/\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> /-- Documented Montgomery surcharge, computed in exact Nat arithmetic. -/\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> def surcharge (a f : UInt64) : Nat :=\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ((a.toNat % 4294967296 + (f.toNat % 2013265921) * 4294967296) * 943718400) % 2013265921\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[1028.698755, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[1028.698778, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.69901, "o", "def candidateSpec : AuthorizationSpec where\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[1028.699047, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.699284, "o", "  accepts b a f := a.toNat + surcharge a f ≤ b.toNat\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[1028.69932, "o", "> "]
[1028.699578, "o", "  output b a f total := total.toNat = a.toNat + surcharge a f\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[1028.699611, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[1028.700084, "o", "theorem surcharge_lt (a f : UInt64) : surcharge a f < 2013265921 := Nat.mod_lt _ (by decide)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[1028.700118, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
